    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Number of approved and enforced policies and guidelines for leveraging renewable energy investments by Year 2
2.	Number of sitios with off-grid rural electrification plans using renewable energy by End of Project (EOP)
3.	Number of businesses who have accreditation or applied for DOE accreditation by End of Project (EOP) to manufacture, fabricate or supply locally-produced renewable energy components
4.	Number of funded and implemented renewable energy projects championed or facilitated by LGU-based renewable energy focal points by End of Project (EOP)
5.	Number of renewable energy projects facilitated by operational provincial-level renewable energy market service centers by End of Project (EOP)
6.	Number of renewable energy projects that were designed based on information and technical advice obtained from the established renewable energy knowledge platform by End of Project (EOP)
7.	Cumulative Number of of installed capacity registered in the renewable energy established in the &quot;capitalized&quot; renewable energy market by End of Project (EOP)
8.	Number of renewable energy developers registered in the RER by End of Project (EOP)
9.	Number of of renewable energy projects that are being developed through the PPF by End of Project (EOP)
10.	Number of bankable renewable energy plans completed by other LGUs who were interested in renewable energy-based energy systems by Year 3
11.	Number of certified technicians for renewable energy equipment assembly and supply working with locally DOE accredited renewable energy manufacturing entities by End of Project (EOP)
12.	Number of of installed capacity of renewable energy projects being implemented that received support from new or improved renewable energy financial mechanisms, by End of Project (EOP)
13.	Number of of installed capacity of renewable energy projects resulting from accelerated expediting of renewable energy service contracts by End of Project (EOP)</narrative>
    </description>
